WEBVTT

00:02:28.394 --> 00:02:31.397
So let alone data
with competitors or partners.

00:02:31.981 --> 00:02:33.941
And therein lies the dilemma,

00:02:33.983 --> 00:02:39.030
because if we want to have a chance
at really combating climate change,

00:02:39.030 --> 00:02:43.784
we need to have our cities become
as smart and as connected

00:02:43.826 --> 00:02:46.621
as quickly as possible,
and as many cities as possible.

00:02:47.163 --> 00:02:51.292
So we need to overcome
this fear of data sharing

00:02:51.334 --> 00:02:54.754
and move towards the smart-city future.

00:02:55.588 --> 00:02:58.674
But why is it that companies
fear sharing data?

00:02:59.175 --> 00:03:01.135
Well, it’s what I call “FOMA”.